  "description": "Go full speed, discover nature, experience adventure: Whatever you’re up to with your gravel bike – the Backroad GRX RX600 can do it. With its lightweight, versatile and comfortable carbon frame, it builds the perfect basis. Moreover, it comes with reliable parts that have proven themselves in off-road use, such as the Shimano RX810 rear derailleur with 1x11 gears – precise, low-maintenance and with a wide gear range for varied terrain. The wide handlebar, gravel tyres with all-round tread and powerful hydraulic disc brakes ensure comfort and control. Experience the freedom that only a gravel bike can give you – and a riding experience that only carbon can offer. With this setup, you are ready to ride anywhere. More long distance | Endurance Flex is fun: The deep cut-out in the seat tube and the carbon seat post provide a massive increase in comfort, while the balanced frame geometry offers perfect handling on the road, gravel and technical terrain. More off-road | Action The frame and fork allow for a tyre width of up to 45 mm with 700c and up to 47 mm with 650b wheels. For rougher road conditions, perfectly adapted protectors at the down tube and chainstays protect the paint. More experience | Adventure With its many attachment points for bottle cages, Anything Cages or bags, the Backroad offers ultimate versatility for day trips or bikepacking tours. ¹ Weight approx. 9.1 kg. May vary by up to +/- 5% due to manufacturing tolerances. Weight with frame colour dusty purple, size 57 cm, without pedals.",
